{"product":{"id":15836061466998,"title":"Microduck","body_html":"\u003ch2\u003ePlayful, Programmable, and Built to Move.\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompact biped robot designed for physical AI, reinforcement learning, and play. With 15 motors, built-in sensors, and an open-source software stack, it can walk, crouch, grasp objects, recover from falls, and learn entirely new behaviors through simulation and sim-to-real training.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eKey Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e15 motors for whole-body movement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWide-angle front camera\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompact 8×8 ToF LiDAR\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2 built-in IMUs\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArticulated grasping beak\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMicrophones and speaker\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2 NFC antennas (head and beak)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRockchip RK3566 + AI accelerator\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1GB RAM + 32GB storage\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cspan\u003eRemovable NP-F550 battery (a\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003epprox. 1 hour battery life)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e25 cm tall, 780 g\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGamepad included\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eReady to Play, Open to Build\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMicroduck comes with built-in behaviors and an included controller, so you can start playing right away. Developers can use the open-source SDK to create new behaviors, train reinforcement learning policies in simulation, and deploy them to the real robot.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eShipping \u0026amp; Availability\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePre-order price: \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e$399 before taxes and shipping.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFirst deliveries targeted before Christmas 2026.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable at launch in US\/Canada\/EU\/UK\/Norway\/Switzeland\/Japan and South Korea. More countries available later.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Pollen Robotics SAS","product_type":"Product","created_at":"2026-08-10T15:22:12+02:00","handle":"microduck","updated_at":"2026-09-01T14:58:38+02:00","published_at":"2026-08-27T09:22:51+02:00","template_suffix":"microduck","published_scope":"web","tags":"","variants":[{"id":58529943454070,"product_id":15836061466998,"title":"Cream","price":"340.00","sku":null,"position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"Cream","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-08-24T16:25:04+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-01T14:58:38+02:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":1200,"image_id":84887104913782,"weight":1.2,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"EUR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":58529943486838,"product_id":15836061466998,"title":"Graphite","price":"340.00","sku":null,"position":2,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"Graphite","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-08-24T16:25:04+02:00","updated_at":"2026-09-01T14:5